'''Keepers of Divan''' are [[NPC]]s that can be found in the {{Zone|Mines of Divan}}. Giving [[Scavenged Items]] to them will allow the player to obtain the {{Item|Jade Crystal}}. Talking to the first '''Keeper''' will give the player a {{Item|Metal Detector}}.

